  "Question": "Which of the following surveys is suitable for a census?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Finding out the lifespan of a batch of light bulbs",
    "B": "Finding out the weights of 45 students in a class",
    "C": "Finding out how audiences nationwide rate a particular film",
    "D": "Finding out the water quality of the Yangtze River"
